00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:16.630
So we're going to talk about
four different main themes

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:17.130
today.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:19.662
We're going to talk about
your specific industry

00:01:19.662 --> 00:01:21.870
