could conduct a compliance

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:25.140
assessment of what your
regulatory compliance needs may

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:25.680
be.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:30.270
Now, you may not be in a
regulated industry at all.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:32.580
Or you could be working with
European data protection

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:36.270
issues, or a bank, or
working with healthcare.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:38.566
So the point is helping you
