things that you can focus on

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:47.520
to help conduct an assessment of
Google Cloud Services, G Suite

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:50.869
specifically, so you can conduct
a meaningful risk assessment.

00:01:50.869 --> 00:01:52.410
The next thing that
we're going to do

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:54.390
is talk about
contracts to show you

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:56.880
where we are taking these
obligations we talk about,

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.984
